KNOWNBUG
empty_argument1.sv
--module main --bound 0
^\[main\.p0\] always .* == 156: PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[main\.p1\] always .* == 426: PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[main\.p2\] always .* == 453: PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[main\.p3\] always .* == 123: PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[main\.p4\] always .* == 129: PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Empty positions in the argument list of a subroutine call
(1800-2017 13.5.3, A.6.9 list_of_arguments) are not supported: a
leading empty position is silently dropped by the parser, and any other
empty position is a syntax error.
